window.products.push({"id":540065,"name":"Non-stick Round Aluminum Griddle for Stove Tops and Gas or Electric Grills, Marble Coated - Leaderware (28cm)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61skLxqQgtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"When cooking indoors or outdoors, you want to make sure that you make healthy, smart decisions that will still give you amazing foods. You will immediately notice a difference when you use our non-stick, aluminum marble frying pan. Our pan has unique qualities that are hard to find outside of Leaderware. When using ordinary frying pans, it is obnoxious how foods stick and crumble because the pan’s surface isn’t made of the right materials to provide a good cooking experience. With high-quality griddle technology, our pans have impressive non-stick capabilities that will help you avoid using loads of butter, oil, or other unhealthy fat alternatives that can increase high blood pressure and cholesterol levels over time. You can use little to no grease and still have a great cooking experience over and over again. Once you get our non-stick pan you will be set for all indoor and outdoor cooking. Whether you’re using a range, or a gas, electric, or propane grill, our non-stick pan will still work its magic. When camping, many people prefer to use bulky cast iron pans that are super heavy and need oil or flimsy foldable pans that have questionable non-stick coating. Our pans are lightweight, 4mm thick, and the perfect size for camping and other forms of travel. Although our pans are black like most other non-stick pans, they have a unique marble patterned coat that gives them extra class. Their color and style allow them to fit into any kitchen no matter the decor or style. The 9 inch heavy-duty plastic handle has a hole near the end for alternate storage options including hanging from walls, tool holders, hooks, racks, or cabinets. Another perk of our non-stick pans is their ability to ensure that food is cooked evenly. They also help to avoid burnt food and other common kitchen problems. Leaderware has a variety of other kitchen items to give you the best cookware around.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61skLxqQgtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Leaderware","source_asin":"B07F7FGSQJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-540065","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F7FGSQJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F7FGSQJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
