window.products.push({"id":540157,"name":"Tovolo Groovy Ice Pop Molds, Drip-Guard Handle, 4 Ounce Ice Pops, Set of 6 Ice Pop Molds, Popsicle Makers with Reusable Sticks, Mess-Free Frozen Treat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LLigueBFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stay cool with these Groovy Ice Pop Molds from Tovolo. Make yourself a sweet treat reminiscent of the ice cream truck—but do it without leaving the comfort of your home. These groovy ice pop molds create the classic shape that call to mind warm summer afternoons and the sweet sound of the neighborhood ice cream truck. Share these memories with your loved ones as you enjoy a homemade frozen treat. Simply pour the mixture into the molds and freeze for the easiest, grooviest afternoon snack ever. Sturdy base does not wobble or tip in the freezer, ensuring minimal disruption during freezing time. Plastic molds fit securely into inserts in the base to keep the pops upright as they freeze. Once frozen, individual molds can be removed from the base to make it easier to pull the frozen ice pop out of the mold. Run the mold under warm water for easier release. Mix and match your favorite fruit juices, yogurt, pureed fruits and vegetables, leftover smoothies, ice cream, and more for unique treats every time. Mix up your favorite flavor combinations then pour the liquid into the molds, set in the base. Once filled, gently insert the sticks into the liquid, and freeze until solid. Each mold holds 4 fluid ounces. Reduce sticky hands and lost juice with these unique drip-guard handles. The base creates a small bowl around the center stick, which collects any drips from melting ice pops. The drip-guard snaps over the plastic mold while freezing, so the ice pop is always contained within the bowl for a mess-free frozen treat. Made of BPA-free plastic. Dishwasher-safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LLigueBFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tovolo","source_asin":"B0C656BBFJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-540157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C656BBFJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C656BBFJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":540158,"name":"BIOWEAVES 100% Organic Cotton 1 Fitted Sheet Only, 300 Thread Count Soft Sateen Weave GOTS Certified with deep Pockets (King, Natural)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wZhCwORmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Organic Cotton 100% ORGANIC COTTON: Certified with GOTS (Global Organic Textile Standard), fine yarn (made with long staple cotton fibers) in a single ply is used to make this amazingly soft 300 thread count fabric. Switch to non-toxic & chemical free bedding that is luxurious & durable. KING FITTED SHEET ONLY: 1 fully elasticized king fitted bottom bed sheet sold separately measuring 78” x 80” + 17” (deep pockets) perfectly fitting King sized mattresses from 9” to 18” deep. It features a beautiful sateen weave with extravagant softness. Foot indicator label is stitched on the shorter side of the sheet for ease of use. This is NOT A SHEET SET. FITTED SHEET ONLY. RIGHT CHOICE: Shield your body from allergies & sensitivities caused by non-organic chemical dyes & pesticides by choosing organic cotton sheets. Feel proud about the positive environmental impact. Our products are made ethically, using sustainable processes & recyclable packaging materials. All our sheets are made at Fair Trade Certified facilities. MATCHING BEDDING: Buy matching pillow cases, flat sheets, duvet covers sets & sheet sets along with this fitted sheet to find the right look for your home’s décor by clicking on the “BIOWEAVES” link given above. SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: We rigorously test for pilling, shrinkage & durability before using any fabric. Each piece goes through 3 rigorous quality checks before being shipped so that you have a great experience. All this is also backed up with an incredible customer service making this a completely risk free & satisfactory purchase for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wZhCwORmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BIOWEAVES","source_asin":"B07Q2G8Y2S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-540158","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q2G8Y2S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q2G8Y2S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
