window.products.push({"id":540576,"name":"Rinpon Double Fitted Design PU Round Fitted Tablecloth, Anti-Tear Wipeable Elastic Round Tablecloth, Soft-Touch Fitted Table Cloth, Waterproof Oil-Pro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WYBXkCi2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH QUALITY FIT: The rinpon round fitted tablecloth is made of thickened soft spandex-polyester blended fabric. The tablecloth itself is elastic in addition to the elastic band on the edge, which double guarantees a tight fit on the tabletop. So it also is a round outdoor table cover, the general wind can't blow it away. PREMIUM DURABLE MATERIALS: The surface of the tablecloth is added with a stronger Pu film than the round vinyl tablecloth, which is waterproof, oil-proof and stain-resistant, protecting your table from being soaked by various liquids or scratched, and the tablecloth will not wrinkle or crack after long-term use. WIDELY SUITABLE: This round elastic tablecloth is suitable for indoor and outdoor daily activities such as dining table, card table, picnic, banquet, coffee table, party, birthday, cafe, etc.In different usage scenarios, the rinpon round tablecloth will closely fit your table, and multiple tablecloths of different sizes and colors are also available for you to deal with various usage scenarios. ROUND TABLECLOTH SIZE SELECTION: This rinpon round tablecloth can be fitted on round tables 40\"-44\" in diameter. According to the actual thickness of the table, the applicable range will be different, so if the size of the round table is close to the maximum size of this tablecloth size range, it is recommended to choose a round tablecloth with a larger size range. REDUCE MAINTENANCE TIME: After each use, you only need to wipe off the stains on the desktop with a wet paper towel. There is no need for frequent machine washing or ironing.However, if you want to wash the tablecloth (machine wash), be sure to use a laundry bag to protect the elastic band around the edge of the tablecloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WYBXkCi2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rinpon","source_asin":"B09Y1P425H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-540576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y1P425H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y1P425H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
