window.products.push({"id":540661,"name":"Bed Hog His & Hers 4 Piece Sheet Set 300 Thread Count 100% Cotton Sateen Printed Sheet Set, Hotel Collection Soft Luxury Bedding (Queen, Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nvnFdYh3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Bed Hog His and Hers sheet sets were created to promote peace in the bedroom. The Luxurious Bed Hog His and Hers sheet sets and pillowcases makes a great giftfor any occasion. These high quality sheets are made with fine quality single ply yarns and single pick insertion in a sateen weave. They are soft, durable and generously sized. The design is reversible and stylish and enhances any room decor. They have the signature line down the middle to define the sleeper's side of the bed. The flat sheet pillowcases have a 4 inch white attached cuff. The flat sheet has a cuff on each end and can be turned depending on which side you sleeep on. They are funny, cute, nice looking, super soft and comfortable. We get reviews 5 star, all the time where people bought them as a gift for Valentines Day, Anniversary, Wedding, Christmas, Birthday, Mother's Day, Father's Day, or make up... intended to be a playful reminder who's on the right side of the bed. They are more often used for every day because of the comfort. They are weighted just right and the fabric is excellent. They are machine washable. Follow care instructions on the sew in label. They come 1 flat sheet, 1 fitted sheet and 2 pillowcases per package - perfect for bride and groom gift or any couple needing to keep the peace!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nvnFdYh3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bed Hog","source_asin":"B07CJHCRKN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-540661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CJHCRKN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CJHCRKN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
