window.products.push({"id":540899,"name":"Tribesigns Vanity Table Set with 3-Color LED Lighted Mirror, Modern Makeup Vanity Dressing Table with 2 Drawers and Stool, Vanity Dresser Desk for Wom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AxPLtJe1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Simple & Delicate 2 IN 1 Design - Removable round cosmetic mirror and square desktop make it a refined style and easier to make up. Combining the golden metal frame and white table, the geometric line design on the surface of the drawer adds a modern sense to this vanity dressing table. With the removal of an upper mirror, the makeup vanity can be used as a sturdy desk, writing table, or console table. Touch Screen Dimming Mirror - The vanity table adopted a NEW high-sensitivity smart sensor switch to control the LED light, touch the button to adjust 3 kinds of lights: yellow light, natural light, and warm light; you can adjust the visual choices according to different makeup needs, which is different from another external switch, more convenient, and intelligent! Mirror Size: 17.72\"(W)* 3.74\"(D)*19.69\"(H) Adequate Storage Capacity - Features 2 big drawers with geometric line design for keeping all of your makeup, and accessories corralled, while a large tabletop offers plenty of room for quick and easy access. This versatile and multipurpose vanity set is chic in design and delicate in detail, it’s absolutely a great gift for your beloved one on birthday, Valentine’s Day, Mother’s Day, and Christmas! Sturdy & Elegant Structure - Crafted with a strong \"X\" metal frame and E1-graded MDF wood, this makeup vanity desk will serve you for a long-time use; The outer coating is made of gold paint, looks elegant and beautiful. Leg pads are adjustable to meet your different height needs for desk. Proper height and soft cushioned seats will ease your fatigue, it can be placed completely under the table without taking up extra space. EASY ASSEMBLY & 100% SATISFACTION - All parts and hardware, plus step-by-step instructions are included for easy assembly. Tribesigns provide 18 months warranty and friendly customer service. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AxPLtJe1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tribesigns","source_asin":"B09JZ888D4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-540899","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JZ888D4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JZ888D4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":540900,"name":"Pizza Board and Pizza Cutter Set | Includes an etched wooden pizza board, pizza cutter and 6 stainless steel pizza knives | From Jean Patrique","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810d00k6rzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PIZZA BOARD AND PIZZA CUTTER SET - A specially designed pizza board, razor sharp pizza cutter and 6 quality pizza knives combine in this set to make serving and sharing fresh pizza the joyous occasion it should be! ETCHED WOODEN PIZZA BOARD - Grooves have been cut into the board at regular intervals to guide you as you cut 8 perfect slices of Pizza. RAZOR SHARP PIZZA CUTTER/WHEEL - Quickly and easily slice up a pizza in a few smooth strokes. 6 STAINLESS STEEL PIZZA KNIVES - The large, rounded blades are able to both cut through pizza easily and transport slices to your plate without the risk of dropping anything. MULTI-PURPOSE - This pizza board can also be used to serve up fajitas, slice up salad and more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810d00k6rzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jean-Patrique","source_asin":"B01G5AWN7G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-540900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01G5AWN7G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01G5AWN7G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
