window.products.push({"id":540946,"name":"Pampas Grass Decor Tall Fluffy Dried Flowers for Vase | 30PCs Pompous Grass with Stems - 16\" Natural Faux Pampas Grass I Home and Living Room Wheat Pa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dUJcPqF1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"OUR PECULIAR FEATURES -.Our pampas grass never shed leaves or has a stench smell. Stems are fluffy, durable and Strong Which cannot break easily. Soft natural pampas grass is well decorated in all seasons which will add different colors to your monotonous life! PREMIUM QUALITY –Pampas Grass Material is 100%pure & natural. We use high quality packaging materials to protect our pampas grass stems in the box during shipping. We work with carefully selected sources to provide an outstanding quality product that will be admired in your home for a long time. HOW TO USE - Place natural pampas grass stems in sunshine for a few hours after opening from packaging. When you’re ready to place it in a vase, turn them over and spray with matte clear varnish or natural hairspray. It will increase its lifespan. 2-3 days later the leaves will be fluffy. After that you can use this beautiful natural dried pampas grass as decor or gift. Adding some artificial grass could set your Musing room into Ecstasy. COUNTLESS USES - Used for House, Office, Party, Garden, Hotel, Cafes, Festival, Celebration, Wedding centerpieces, door wreath bridal bouquet, wedding arch, even dress up a beautiful wedding table backdrop with feathery pampas decorative flowers, Balcony, etc. You can use them to decorate Vases, Hanging Baskets, or Diy Flower arrangements to make your favorite bouquet. IDEAL SIZE - Our Pampas Grass Flower is about 13.8 inch (NO VASE INCLUDED), and with Vase it is about 23.6 inches. Feathers have been blow dried to enhance beauty while extending longevity. These beautiful flower arrangements will turn heads whatever the occasion!. Suitable for long-term delicate decoration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dUJcPqF1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BARLOO","source_asin":"B08NY2TTB6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-540946","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NY2TTB6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NY2TTB6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
